OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over rape of girl,14,
OL,4,Ain wooded area
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 34-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of raping a 14-year-old girl
OL,8,Fin a wooded area near a roundabout.
OL,10,FThe girl reported she was attacked by a
OL,11,Fman she did not know off the Wide Lane
OL,12,Froundabout, near Mansbridge Road, in
OL,13,FSwaythling, Southampton, shortly before
OL,14,F15:10 BST on Sunday.
OL,16,FHampshire detectives said the man, from
OL,17,FSouthampton, remained in custody.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
